{title: Ei Mom Jochhonay Ango Bhijiye}
{artist: Arati Mukherjee}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm]Ei Mom Jochhonay Ango Bhiji [A#]ye,        Eso Na [Fm]galpo kori
[Fm]Ei Mom Jochhonay Ango Bhiji [A#]ye,        Eso Na [Fm]galpo kori
dekho oi [A#]jhi-limili chand,        sara [G#]rat akashe [C]solma jori
[Fm]Ei Mom Jochhonay Ango Bhiji [A#]ye,        Eso Na [Fm]galpo kori
[F]jafrani oi [A#]alta [F]thonte,        [F]misti hasir [C]golap phonte
mone hoy [A#]bataser oi [D#]dilrubate,        [A#]sur miliye [C]alap dhori
dekho oi [A#]jhi-limili chand,        sara [G#]rat akashe [C]solma jori
[Fm]Ei Mom Jochhonay Ango Bhiji [A#]ye,        Eso Na [Fm]galpo kori
[F]ei rupasi [D#]raat aar oi rupali,        [F]chand [F]bole jege [D#]thako e lagan
[F]aar kakho [A#]no phire pabe [F]nako,        [F]makhmaler oi [A#]sajni [F]ghase
[F]bosle na hoy [C]ektu pase,        mone hoy [A#]mahuari [D#]atar mekhe
[A#]tomar kole [C]ghumiye pori,        dekho oi [A#]jhi-limili chand
sara [G#]rat akashe [C]solma jori,        [Fm]Ei Mom Jochhonay Ango Bhiji [A#]ye
Eso Na [Fm]galpo kori
